TITLE:: RCFObject
summary:: A spatial effect unit orgnsms can send to
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCOrgnsm, Classes/RCMatrix, Classes/RCOrgnsmRegistry

DESCRIPTION::
Port of the proto-library's fobject: an in bus, a Synth in the song's fobject group, a priority and a transparency function code::(zpos, pos) → 0..1::. When an orgnsm's attributes carry code::instrument_flex::, each event takes fobjects by increasing priority until the transparency budget reaches 1 and the remainder goes to the orgnsm's own out (code::\outs:: / code::\outamps:: and the code::__N_out:: SynthDef variant). A failing transparency function counts as 0. link::#-addSynthDef:: wraps a sound function in an in-graph space transform (rotation and width matrices recomputed on code::\recompute_space::) and passes the output through code::Sanitize::.

